# EMC chemistry file, written by scripts/make_benchmark_systems.py (benchmark).
#
# Prepare (from this directory):
#   emc.pl input.esh                              -> build.emc
#   emc_linux_x86_64 build.emc                    -> pmma_50k.data, pmma_50k.params
#
# Notes:
# - Columns are separated by tabs (EMC manual, Sec. 4.5.2).
# - No field_location: EMC uses its own PCFF files (EMC_ROOT/field/cff/pcff, the default field location).
# - Benchmark, 50 repeat units *CC(C)(C(=O)OC)*, 66 chains, built at 0.5 g/cc and compressed to 1.2 g/cc in LAMMPS.

ITEM	OPTIONS

project	pmma_50k
seed	2026

replace	true
build_dir	.
field	pcff
field_id	pcff
density	0.5
ntotal	50028

ITEM	END

ITEM	GROUPS

repeat	*CC(C)(C(=O)OC)*	1	repeat:2
head	*C	1	repeat:1
tail	*C	1	repeat:2

ITEM	END

ITEM	CLUSTERS

poly	alternate	1

ITEM	END

ITEM	POLYMERS

poly
1	repeat	50	head	1	tail	1

ITEM	END
